.TH start-cli-net-gateway-edit 1  "edit "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-net\-gateway\-edit \- Rename a gateway or change its DNS servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli net gateway edit\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-dns\fR] [\fB\-\-automatic\-dns\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rename a gateway or change its DNS servers
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Name of the gateway
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\fR \fI<DNS>\fR
Static DNS server; repeat for several
.TP
\fB\-\-automatic\-dns\fR
Use the DNS servers the gateway provides
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Gateway identifier
